      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} I agree with the fix to prevent the freezing issue.\n\nHowever, that issue was already resolved in the previous Beta, and I thought that behavior was ideal.\n\nThe current Open Beta goes a step further and also causes the player's head to rotate while dragging the window, which is the reason I submitted this Canny post.",
